WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.740
Sawa!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.130
What are you doing? You just gave birth.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:17.160
Are you stupid? You're going to die.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.440
You can't underestimate Jin Kuzuhara.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:23.790
I am aware of that.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.670
But you've got Asahi back!

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.160
That's why I'm going.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.810
I did what you talked about.

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:36.670
For the first time ever, 
I imagined the future.

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:43.600
I want Asahi and your child to live 
in a world with more freedom.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.770
That's why I'm going to settle things.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.090
Well, that's just fantastic.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:56.030
My man's coming. We'll take Asahi with us.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.500
Thank you.

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:03.790
I guess I really do hate you.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.470
Yes. So do I.

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:18.300
Damn it... What is wrong with her?

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:29.940
I hear they're stockpiling all the Ryumyaku.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:32.570
They better not be! We don't have enough!

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:37.320
At 24:00, be waiting at Shinobazu Pond.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.330
<i>There is only one person I need to kill.</i>

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:58.220
Civilians aren't permitted past this point.

00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:01.310
My name is Sawa Karasumori!

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.720
I am here to provide the shogun 
with what he's been after.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:07.660
Karasumori? What?

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:11.630
Onee-chan?

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:15.800
Onee-chan!

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:34.390
You're Karasumori?

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:36.020
Capture her at once!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:42.100
What the?!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.390
A bunch of crows!

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.140
What the hell is this?

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.760
This is...

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.650
Move too much and you'll fall.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:04.670
That voice... Jin Kuzuhara!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.360
You took Janome's drugs?

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:11.170
I did. Another lie.

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:16.020
Not just to you this time. 
I gave Yoshinobu a placebo.

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.760
What are you trying to accomplish?

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:22.830
I'm going to eliminate 
the things threatening you.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.700
There was no other way.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:38.610
I intended to accept the weight 
of it all, to bring it to an end.

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:47.320
You want to end it? 
What gives you the right?!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:54.220
If it weren't for you, I would've 
killed Yoshinobu myself!

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:56.740
Yoshinobu has lost his mind.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:04:02.610
As I explained, he plans to drain you 
of your blood to keep himself safe.

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:05.660
And what? You think you've saved me?

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.930
You have never been fair 
with me, Kuzuhara-san.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.970
You've never told me 
the things I need to know,

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:17.520
when I have so much that I want to ask you.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:24.710
But right now, what I need 
to do is kill Yoshinobu.

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:27.020
And if you intend to get in the way,

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:30.200
Jin Kuzuhara, I'll kill you!

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:33.710
I'm not letting you go to the palace.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:45.010
<b>Episode 12: Confidential File 707,
 The Land of Blessed Words</b>

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:45.010
You, who would violate the foundation 
of what makes a man,

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:50.010
dwell now in the blue that surges within!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.520
Are you that desperate 
to protect Yoshinobu?!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:24.010
You'd kill my family and 
murder Tsuki, all for his sake?!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:28.630
You deceive me, manipulate me, 
leave me flailing in the dark...

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:32.530
I won't let you get away with it! I won't!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.830
Never!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.830
Why won't you fight back?

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.750
Fight me!

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:04.590
Why?

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.010
Why won't you fight?!

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:12.510
You have a home to return to.

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:16.520
After everything you've taken from me...

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:22.220
Starting tomorrow, 
let's take turns writing in it.

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.270
You'll be first, Asahi.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:32.210
I'm going to kill Yoshinobu! 
I have to kill him!

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.200
Why?!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:39.440
Your wrath... your pain, and your anguish...

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:42.790
I'll take it all.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.510
Take another step and you die!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:52.640
You don't have to kill anyone else. 
I'll take it from here.

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.770
Why?!

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:12.530
You're entitled... to some answers.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:15.320
I wanted to protect you.

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:22.830
On that day... I made a vow. 
That I'd protect you.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:29.590
Your mother had a white crow 
with her, just like yours.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:34.660
She was a kind woman who wanted nothing 
more than for her children to be happy.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:38.660
Wait... The person you loved...

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.100
That's right.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:43.600
Did she... feel the same way?

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:50.110
She was as pure as the white 
of that feather, to the very end.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.620
I have been unfair.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:01.620
I told myself it was all to protect you, 
but I was protecting myself.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.210
I want to give back the precious
 moments that I took.

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:08.130
That's why you saved Asahi?

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:15.780
You think that makes up 
for what you've done?!

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.300
No.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:21.630
I did it because she wants to live with you.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:28.710
It doesn't matter what form your life 
takes... as long as you're alive...

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:32.380
You need to go back to her 
once this is over.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.910
I won't obey your orders.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:38.580
It's not an order.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:42.200
You just need to do what 
your heart tells you.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:54.680
What are you going to do?!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.680
I'm going to settle things personally.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.200
Wait! In your condition, you'll...

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:01.430
Sawa!

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:03.950
You need to survive into the new era!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.000
Kuzuhara-san!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.850
Kuzuhara-san?!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:11.440
Jin Kuzuhara!

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.040
Who goes there?!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:58.910
N-Not another step!

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:05.370
You're... Yoshinobu Tokugawa?

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.070
Are you one of the Kuchinawa remnants?!

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:11.510
Take as much money as you want!

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:17.150
I took refuge in a symbol 
as a way to survive...

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:20.910
And this is the truth?!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:36.500
It's over. All of it.

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:46.160
Accepting reality is difficult and painful.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:47.600
But...

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:52.560
I finally realize that there is something 
in this world that I care about

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:55.760
more than my own life.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:11:00.930
And that's all I need!

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:04.730
D-Don't do it! Don't...

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.220
Did you forget?

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:11.910
I'm the man who cleans up 
the trash of this world.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.980
Kuzuhara-san...

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.150
You idiot.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.140
You damned idiot!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.390
Snow?

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:16.390
<i>The Ryumyaku that was being prioritized 
for the palace has been secured.</i>

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:19.650
<i>Once preparations are complete, 
it will be distributed...</i>

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:53.740
Asahi.

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:07.450
Are you sure we shouldn't 
have brought her along?

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:11.200
What were we supposed to do? 
She's a stubborn one.

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:19.570
Onee-chan... Onee-chan will come back.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:26.720
<b>Yuki</b>

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:28.720
"This was the first gift 
you ever gave me. Thank you."

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:34.120
"I'm looking forward to 
seeing what you write next."

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.330
"Sawa."

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:44.640
Sawa...

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:45.990
Sawa-chan?

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:49.560
I like it! Sawa Ichinose!

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:53.210
Oh, she's going to be such 
a beauty! What'll we do?!

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:55.100
Daddy's a bit of an airhead, huh?

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:56.180
Sawa-chan...

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:59.630
Her name is going to be...

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:18.030
Welcome home, Onee-chan!

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.600
I'm home, Asahi.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.860
A new government is being founded!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.860
Extra, extra!

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:33.220
I have something for you.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.470
What is it?

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:40.260
It's called dayflower. When they bloom, 
they're a beautiful shade of blue.

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:43.380
It'll grow into flowers? Thank you!

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:48.020
Are you hungry? I've got some food.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:52.430
I think I'd like some fresh air.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.640
Aw, if you say so.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:18.680
Your usual hairstyle is good, 
but this looks nice, too.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:23.310
Maybe I'll keep it like this, then.

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:34.120
Those white clouds look so soft...

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.720
Clouds?

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:37.540
See?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:45.630
Summer is on the way.

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:52.000
Your hands are cold.

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:55.690
I'm feeling a bit tired.

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:58.310
Are you okay? Is it too cold?

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:04.960
It's warm.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.700
Yeah. It is, huh?

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:14.540
The salted rice bran's gone bad, y'know. 
We'll need to make some more.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:17.220
I guess we will.

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:22.450
And then we can use it to pickle some 
radishes, and those carrots you like.

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:24.090
Yes...

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:34.920
Y'know, Onee-chan...

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.380
Let's make them.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.300
Make what?

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.010
Pressed flowers.

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:44.000
Good idea.

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:48.810
What flowers would be good, I wonder...

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:52.290
What kinds of flowers bloom 
in the summer, anyway?

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:57.210
Cape jasmine... bellflowers... lilies...

00:17:57.900 --> 00:17:59.210
And then...

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:02.310
And then...

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:06.580
And then what?

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.220
Asahi orchids.

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:11.330
They have the same name as me!

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.390
What kind of flower is it?

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:18.130
Asahi... I'm... sorry...

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:20.560
Oh, okay, then.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:23.580
You can rest now.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:25.040
<b>Sawa-oneechan, I love you.
 -Asahi</b>

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:28.190
I'll be sure to wake you up.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.280
Hey, Onee-chan...

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:56.320
Let's have something to eat later.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:32.620
<b>Morning Dew Used Bookstore</b>

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:36.560
<i>"May 7th. Clear skies, with some clouds."</i>

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:39.120
<i>"Dear Sawa-oneechan...</i>

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:44.180
<i>Onee-chan, how do you 
make your anger quiet down?</i>

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:45.780
<i>Temporarily Closed
 -Management</i>

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:50.380
<i>I don't think I can stop the feeling 
that's welling up from deep inside me.</i>

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:54.170
<i>I wonder what you would do.</i>

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:58.150
<i>What you would think... what you would do.</i>

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:58.150
<b>ONEE-CHAN YOU LIAR
 I HATE YOU</b>

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:58.150
i'm sorry i said 
i hated you

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:01.560
<i>I've lived my entire life 
imagining these things.</i>

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:04.980
<i>I want to be like you in any way I can.</i>

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:07.410
Onee-chan, I'm going to try hard on the diary... 
Nana brought me a gift... 
I'm not going to cry anymore.
 I want to be like you...

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:12.350
<i>You saved me, and now I want the same 
kind of strength to save someone else.</i>

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.820
<i>I need something that asahi, the flower, lacks.</i>

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:17.920
I still remember the day I last saw you. 
And the day you first took me in. 
I don't even remember my own birthday. 
Hana-san says it should be the day that 
I was healed thanks to your blood. 
I hope you're okay with that. 
I don't want you looking down from the sky 
and being angry. Would you approve?

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:22.170
<i>Something Hana-san once told me 
has been stuck in my head.</i>

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:26.390
<i>I wonder what it is that I'm lacking.</i>

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:31.190
<i>There are so many things 
I wanted you to teach me.</i>

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:37.040
<i>But since that can't happen anymore, 
I'll have to learn myself.</i>

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:38.190
Onee-chan, how do you make your anger quiet down?
 I don't think I can stop the feeling 
that's welling up inside me...

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:43.930
<i>And until I track down each and every 
one of the answers, I refuse to die."</i>

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:44.610
There are so many things I wanted you to teach me. 
But since that can't happen anymore,
 I'll have to learn myself.

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:45.880
Satsuki...

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:52.200
It's rude to dig into people's 
things without permission.

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:02.680
Say, Asahi...

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:07.340
Why'd you stop writing in it?

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:10.740
<i>"Which is why I'm still alive, to this day."</i>

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:11.800
Well...

00:22:13.030 --> 00:22:18.720
<i>"Onee-chan, I turned 17 today."</i>

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:29.890
Because I don't want it to end yet.

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:43.510
<i>"Even when the snow has melted and vanished,</i>

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:47.150
<i>a morning sun will rise 
as the journey continues."</i>
